# The Alliance Rogue level 10 quests, one chain per home town, each ending
# with the Blade of Cunning (7298), a dagger:
# - Goldshire (Humans, and Skyborne, who reach Stormwind at about 15): Seek
#   out SI: 7 and Snatch and Grab (2205, 2206).
# - Kharanos (Dwarves, Gnomes): Road to Salvation, Simple Subterfugin' and
#   Onin's Report (2218, 2238, 2239).
# - Dolanaar (Night Elves): The Apple Falls and Destiny Calls (2241, 2242).
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers,
# drops and places; travel.json for the inns; Forever's Rogue class
# quest list (data/local/quest-audit/) for the rewards and
# Forever's changes (none for these chains). The quests' race masks take any
# Alliance race; the race split follows where each race is at level 10.
# data/local/mechanics (quest-steps and quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20): the
# Dockmaster's schedule and Sethir's journal come only by Pick Pocket, the
# Dockmaster calls helpers and the dock-house fires break stealth, Onin waits
# stealthed on the spiral tower by Gnomeregan, Syurna stands in the room
# under the Cenarion Enclave, Sethir's Minions and his 8 1/2 minute respawn.
# The dagger is unique: one per character, so take one town's chain (the data
# has no `excl` between them; players report a second one cannot be handed in
# while you hold the first).
# The leveling guides leave most of these out: they teach no spell.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Goldshire

step Seek out SI: 7
  only Human,Skyborne
  tip At 10 Keryn Sylvius, the rogue trainer upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, gives you a package for Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind. Train Pick Pocket if you lack it: this chain needs it.
  level 10
  accept 2205                                 -- Keryn Sylvius

step Master Mathias Shaw
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Head north to Stormwind. Shaw stands upstairs in the SI:7 building in Old Town (the quest says the Barracks; it means SI:7).
  turnin 2205                                 -- Master Mathias Shaw
  accept 2206

step Defias Dockmaster
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip The Defias Dockmaster (level 10, a goblin) works in the dock house at Jerod's Landing, on the river at Elwynn's southern edge, south of Goldshire. Stealth in and Pick Pocket him from behind: the schedule never drops from his corpse. Do not open with Sap or a fight: he calls in three waves of bodyguards. Keep away from the fireplaces in the house; they burn you out of stealth. He is back 2 to 5 minutes after a death.
  collect 7675 quest 2206.1                   -- Defias Shipping Schedule: Pick Pocket the Defias Dockmaster

step Back to Mathias Shaw
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 2206 reward 7298                     -- Master Mathias Shaw, SI:7

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Kharanos

step Road to Salvation
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip At 10 Hogral Bakkan, the rogue trainer in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos, sends you to Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge.
  level 10
  accept 2218                                 -- Hogral Bakkan

step Hulfdan Blackbeard
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip Hulfdan Blackbeard is in the Forlorn Cavern, the rogue quarter in the north of Ironforge: go into the building with a shady dealer outside and down the stairs.
  turnin 2218                                 -- Hulfdan Blackbeard
  accept 2238

step Onin MacHammar
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Head west to Gnomeregan. Beside the road to its entrance stands a wooden spiral tower: Onin waits stealthed on the top platform, next to a level 10 Leper Gnome, so you only see him up close.
  turnin 2238                                 -- Onin MacHammar
  accept 2239

step Back to Hulfdan
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  turnin 2239 reward 7298                     -- Hulfdan Blackbeard, Ironforge

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dolanaar

step The Apple Falls
  only NightElf
  zone Teldrassil
  tip At 10 Jannok Breezesong, the rogue trainer in the Dolanaar inn, gives you a rose for Syurna in Darnassus. If you lose the rose, abandon the quest and take it again.
  level 10
  accept 2241                                 -- Jannok Breezesong

step Syurna
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Head west to Darnassus. Syurna is below ground in the Cenarion Enclave: the way down is the opening at the foot of the split tree left of the Arch Druid's tree, near the nightsaber riding trainer. Her map marker shows above ground.
  turnin 2241                                 -- Syurna
  accept 2242

step Sethir the Ancient
  only NightElf
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Sethir the Ancient (level 12 satyr) lives out on a great branch north of the Oracle Glade: go through the V-shaped gap in the wall north of the glade and out along the branch. Pick his pocket for the journal; killing him does not give it, and a fight brings out three Minions of Sethir. He walks between the main branch and a side branch: wait stealthed at the far end of the main branch and pick him from behind when he comes back. Then Sprint away. He is back 8 1/2 minutes after a death.
  collect 7737 quest 2242.1                   -- Sethir's Journal: Pick Pocket Sethir the Ancient

step Back to Syurna
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  turnin 2242 reward 7298                     -- Syurna, Darnassus
